WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.508 --> 00:00:04.065
Okay Otto

00:00:04.348 --> 00:00:06.000
Time for a game of table tennis H.O.R.S.E.

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:07.100
Let's do it

00:00:07.205 --> 00:00:09.205
Let's start off with an easy one

00:00:09.205 --> 00:00:10.234
Forehand around the net

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:13.335
Your go!

00:00:18.363 --> 00:00:19.103
Not that hard!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:22.813
Fairly easy

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:25.326
Okay, ghost serve into the cup

00:00:31.844 --> 00:00:32.558
There we go!

00:00:41.268 --> 00:00:42.128
Hit the cups?

00:00:42.128 --> 00:00:42.744
Go ahead

00:00:45.924 --> 00:00:46.920
That was a bit too easy

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:47.420
Yeah

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.589
Let's step it up to 5 cups in a row

00:00:49.589 --> 00:00:50.108
Okay

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.724
Okay, serve around the Pongfinity net post

00:01:10.447 --> 00:01:12.447
[You can buy the net from pongfinity.store]

00:01:16.992 --> 00:01:17.702
Was it?

00:01:21.598 --> 00:01:24.630
I will set the score for Miikka to try to beat

00:01:43.175 --> 00:01:45.175
Ok so 56 is the score to beat

00:01:58.637 --> 00:02:00.637
How many did I get?

00:02:01.233 --> 00:02:02.554
Otto won that one

00:02:09.286 --> 00:02:09.891
Easy

00:02:13.808 --> 00:02:15.636
Let's see if Miikka can do this

00:02:28.736 --> 00:02:30.736
That wasn't even close!

00:02:43.157 --> 00:02:45.157
Close but not enough

00:02:45.858 --> 00:02:48.384
The one who drops the egg first looses

00:02:58.397 --> 00:03:00.397
It's starting to break more and more

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:12.885
I don't want it anymore!

00:03:21.457 --> 00:03:24.116
That was like a game of hot potato!

00:03:24.116 --> 00:03:25.868
Yea, I don't want it! Take it!

00:03:26.379 --> 00:03:28.828
Ok so you have to get the ball to roll on the table

00:03:28.952 --> 00:03:29.490
Okay

00:03:35.639 --> 00:03:36.224
Like that

00:03:36.224 --> 00:03:36.933
Not bad

00:03:40.648 --> 00:03:42.419
I think yours was a bit better

00:03:43.211 --> 00:03:45.211
1 point match of mini pong

00:04:12.451 --> 00:04:13.940
Miikka is going to throw this

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.455
And I'm going to hit in the air

00:04:22.658 --> 00:04:23.530
Nice shot!

00:04:23.645 --> 00:04:24.804
That's how you do it

00:04:31.046 --> 00:04:31.710
Close

00:04:32.121 --> 00:04:34.121
Otto, I think you are going to like this one!

00:04:43.246 --> 00:04:45.246
I can also play that game

00:04:55.657 --> 00:04:57.657
Ok Miikka, your turn!

00:04:58.111 --> 00:05:00.111
Yeah... I think we are just going to call it a draw

00:05:00.795 --> 00:05:04.133
And guys if you want to get yourself one of these cool table tennis nets

00:05:04.133 --> 00:05:06.000
Go hit the link in the description

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.725
You can buy them from our web store

00:05:07.725 --> 00:05:08.655
Ready for this?

